# Packing List API — Auth Endpoints
#
# SETUP (do this once before running any request):
#
#   1. Start the server:  go run main.go
#   2. Generate a token:  go run scripts/gen_token.go
#
# Token and host resolve automatically from .env — see requests/README.md
# for how that works. No variables to paste in this file.
#
# Only GET /me is covered here. Login/callback need a real browser
# round-trip and refresh/logout are cookie-based automation not built yet
# — see requests/README.md's "what's deliberately not covered" section.


# ══════════════════════════════════════════
#  GET /me
# ══════════════════════════════════════════

### ✅ 200 — returns the authenticated user's profile
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv DEV_TOKEN}}

###

### 🔒 401 — no token
GET http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}/me
